---
import { FileTree } from "@astrojs/starlight/components"

interface Props {
  lang?: "en" | "zh-cn"
}

const zh = Astro.props.lang === "zh-cn"
---

<figure>
  <figcaption>
    {zh ? "一个 Space，几种普通文件" : "One Space. Ordinary files."}
  </figcaption>
  <FileTree>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <span>Research/</span>
        <span>{zh ? "Space · 本地文件夹" : "Space · a local folder"}</span>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>books.eidos</strong>
            <span>{zh ? "表、字段、记录和视图" : "Tables, fields, records, and views"}</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span>notes.md</span>
            <span>{zh ? "Markdown 笔记" : "Markdown notes"}</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span>assets/</span>
            <ul>
              <li>
                <span>cover.jpg</span>
                <span>{zh ? "书单引用的封面图片" : "A cover image referenced by the book list"}</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </FileTree>
  <p>
    {zh
      ? "books.eidos 中的 Books 表包含 Title、Status 等字段，每条记录代表一本书。“正在读”视图保存筛选和布局。"
      : "Inside books.eidos, the Books table has fields such as Title and Status. Each record represents a book. The Reading view saves its filter and layout."}
  </p>
  <p>
    {zh
      ? "移动数据时，也带上它引用的本地文件。"
      : "When you move the data, include its referenced local files."}
  </p>
</figure>
